674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Y_oct6P16I8Q7kNvwEMLlpf&_nc_oc=AdrupYwSlaogD6_4SrstmEcOWXcSFDq9Wf2RHrDPxH6zU_S7R1ibzKYJy7Ao1WoUzLY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQApnb0tLWmIumOgR7ekojn8s1G_XWmwae97KDJOjz8Zzw&oe=6A637759"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wJAdKvU-vB0Q7kNvwEV8Yic&_nc_oc=Ado8eiLFfx6r7f9-uL7FIpYkl05LP7FuuS6wL626VfHFXT4u72xO3dgfQUhzJ7eGyK8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC9-TIe5bVt-NiPEp9vhzAPo8JOnZHdgkPeEc1MysqOlg&oe=6A638016"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sFllx0n1MEMQ7kNvwFfVeVq&_nc_oc=AdqrmpY12QRBKDSR2IBb4f3dbfV2-YlNFgQnOao2VbZTXzllEHtpe0v_kc6nQsBtD8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBjE0bbSgP8xIyGwuFHZ28empREN_hMB3ZE-7bU9NRBIQ&oe=6A637C31"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip